{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Randstad, Intermediate and Peripheral Zonation according to Wagtendonk & Rietveld (2000)"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:56148"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J.E.C. Dekkers"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"SPINlab, Dept. Spatial Economics, VU University Amsterdam"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/230169988"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J.E.C.  Dekkers"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>This dataset consists of 3 shapefiles based on the COROP (i.e. NUTS3) zonation. Three non-overlapping zones for the Netherlands have been defined: Randstad, Intermediate Zone and Peripheral Zone. The definition of the zones follows from a publication by Wagtendonk, & Rietveld (2000) about spatial developments in the housing sector between 1980 and 1995.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>The link between the zones and the underlying COROP\/NUTS3-regions is maintained in the attribute table of the shapefiles. That way, you can see which COROP\/NUTS3-regions are part of which zone (Randstad, Intermediate Zone, Peripheral Zone).<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Earth and Environmental Sciences","Medicine, Health and Life Sciences","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Randstad, Intermediate and Peripheral Zones"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2006-06-27"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-11-22"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-11-22"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Dekkers, J.E.C. (2006) o.b.v. Wagtendonk, A.W. & P. Rietveld (2000), Ruimtelijke ontwikkelingen woningbouw Nederland 1980-1995; \nEen historisch-kwantitatieve analyse van de ruimtelijke ontwikkelingen in de woningbouw 1980-1995 ter ondersteuning van de Omgevings-effectrapportage Vijfde Nota Ruimtelijke Ordening, \nVrije Universiteit, Amsterdam."]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClas